      runs pbas  calculatefeatures std  vector cv  mat   feature  cv  mat  inputimage feature- empty    
    feature- clear    
 
  cv  mat mag 3   dir inputimage- channels      3  
    
    std  vector cv  mat  rgbchannels 3   
    cv  split  inputimage  rgbchannels l   0  l   3    l  
      
      cv  sobel rgbchannels l   sobelx  cv 32f  1  0  3  1  0 0   
      cv  sobel rgbchannels l   sobely  cv 32f  0  1  3  1  0 0   
 
        
      cv  carttopolar sobelx  sobely  mag l   dir feature- push back mag l    
      sobelx release    
      sobely release    
      
 
    feature- push back rgbchannels 0    
    feature- push back rgbchannels 1    
    feature- push back rgbchannels 2    
    rgbchannels 0  release    
    rgbchannels 1  release    
