    cv  sobel  inputimage  sobely  cv 32f  0  1  3  1  0 0   
 
      
    cv  carttopolar sobelx  sobely  mag 0   dir feature- push back mag 0    
 
    cv  mat temp  
    inputimage- copyto temp   
    feature- push back temp   
    temp release    
    
 
  mag 0  release    
  mag 1  release    
